WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
A little late, Coop.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Yeah, we had a flat.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
It's an Indian surveillance drone.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.400
Solar cells could power an entire farm.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
What'd you do, Murph?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.400
She didn't do nothing.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.000
Murphy's law.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
You're a well-educated man, Coop.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.000
And a trained pilot.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.200
And an engineer.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The world doesn't need any more engineers.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
We didn't run out of planes and television sets.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.000
We ran out of food.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Why did you name me after something that's bad?

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.000
We didn't.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.300
Murphy's law?

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.000
Murphy's law doesn't mean that something bad will happen.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.600
It means that whatever can happen, will happen.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:54.500
We must confront the reality that nothing in our solar system can help us.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.000
Now you need to tell me what your plan is to save the world.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.600
We're not meant to save the world.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.200
We're meant to leave it.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.100
And this is the mission you were trained for.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.900
I've got kids, Professor.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Get out there and save them.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.000
You have no idea when you're coming back.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:35.000
We must reach far beyond our own lifespans.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.000
We must think not as individuals,

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.000
but as a species.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.000
We must confront the reality of interstellar travel.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.200
Murph, I love you forever.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.000
I'm coming back.
